<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>dewiweb – Qt</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/tags/qt/</link><description>Recent content in Qt on dewiweb</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://dewiweb.github.io/en/tags/qt/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>nextevents</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/nextevents/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/nextevents/</guid><description>
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem;">
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dewiweb/nextevents?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;color=6366f1&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="GitHub stars" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents/commits" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/dewiweb/nextevents?style=flat-square&amp;color=10b981&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="Last commit" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/languages/top/dewiweb/nextevents?style=flat-square&amp;color=f59e0b&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>A suite of tools generating &lt;strong>slideshows of Les Champs Libres events&lt;/strong> (Rennes, France) from OpenAgenda data — UHD slides ready for OBS, digital signage and kiosks.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Three variants depending on the infrastructure:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nextevents&lt;/a>&lt;/strong> — Debian/Docker server: scrapes leschampslibres.fr + OpenAgenda, renders &lt;strong>UHD 3840×2160&lt;/strong> PNGs matching the venue&amp;rsquo;s visual identity (Oldschool Grotesk typeface, per-event pastel background), web UI with gallery and auto-refresh&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents-desktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nextevents-desktop&lt;/a>&lt;/strong> — rewritten as a &lt;strong>portable PySide6/Qt app&lt;/strong> (Windows zip, Linux AppImage): same slide generation plus a native fullscreen player, no Docker or server needed&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents-php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nextevents-php&lt;/a>&lt;/strong> — lightweight PHP port for kiosks: self-contained HTML slides (fonts/images in base64), no PNG generation, no dependencies — the kiosk browser does the rendering&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Common features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="common-features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#common-features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Date, duration, venue, price, &lt;strong>audience&lt;/strong> and &lt;strong>accessibility&lt;/strong> (LSF, audio description, surtitling) extracted from OpenAgenda data&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Native-resolution images, FTP/SMB/local sync&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Slide of the day, scheduler, gallery&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nextevents&lt;/a> · &lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents-desktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nextevents-desktop&lt;/a> · &lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/nextevents-php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">nextevents-php&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>See also &lt;a href="https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/" >openagenda-slides&lt;/a> — the generalized version for any public OpenAgenda agenda&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>ptp-monitor</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/audio-spatial/ptp-monitor/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/audio-spatial/ptp-monitor/</guid><description>
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem;">
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/ptp-monitor" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dewiweb/ptp-monitor?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;color=6366f1&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="GitHub stars" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/ptp-monitor/commits" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/dewiweb/ptp-monitor?style=flat-square&amp;color=10b981&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="Last commit" />
&lt;/a>
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/languages/top/dewiweb/ptp-monitor?style=flat-square&amp;color=f59e0b&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/license/dewiweb/ptp-monitor?style=flat-square&amp;color=3b82f6&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Desktop tool (Qt / PySide6) for &lt;strong>passively listening to PTP clock traffic&lt;/strong> on a production audio-over-IP network — to detect problems and record evidence for vendor support cases.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>100% passive&lt;/strong>: it joins the standard PTP multicast group &lt;code>224.0.1.129&lt;/code> (UDP 319/320) and listens. It never sends a single PTP packet and cannot disturb the clock election or timing of the network.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Dante leader (PTPv1)&lt;/strong> — who sends Sync, sync interval, jitter (mean/min/max/σ), leader change history&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>AES67 grandmaster (PTPv2)&lt;/strong> — clock identity, priorities, clock class, steps removed, announce timing&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Per-source stats&lt;/strong> — message types, rates, sequence gaps/dupes, silence detection, non-standard PTP domains&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Malformed packets&lt;/strong> — unparsable datagrams logged with source IP and full hexdump&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Evidence logs&lt;/strong> — chronological JSONL journal + optional full packet capture&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Network-agnostic&lt;/strong> — no hard-coded addresses; friendly device names via &lt;code>devices.json&lt;/code>, reverse DNS and the IEEE OUI database&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Links&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="links">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://github.com/dewiweb/ptp-monitor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Language: Python (Qt / PySide6)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>The UI is currently in French — i18n contributions are welcome.&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote></description></item><item><title>openagenda-slides</title><link>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/openagenda-slides/</guid><description>
