&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/github/license/dewiweb/openagenda-slides?style=flat-square&amp;color=3b82f6&amp;labelColor=1e1e2e" alt="true" />
&lt;/div>
&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Generalization of &lt;a href="https://dewiweb.github.io/en/docs/projets/outils-sceniques/nextevents/" >nextevents&lt;/a>: turns &lt;strong>any public OpenAgenda agenda&lt;/strong> into screen slideshows — one slide per event (image, date, venue, price, audience…) for TVs, kiosks and digital signage, in &lt;strong>16:9, 9:16 portrait or printable A4&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>No technical skills required: download, enter your agenda, click &lt;strong>Generate&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Portable &lt;strong>Qt&lt;/strong> desktop app for Windows and Linux (AppImage) — no install&lt;/li>
&lt;li>One polished slide per event&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Landscape, portrait and printable formats&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Binaries available in GitHub Releases&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
